{"id":3034,"date":"2023-11-29T14:08:55","date_gmt":"2023-11-29T13:08:55","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.jouwweb.nl\/blog\/?p=3034"},"modified":"2024-12-23T12:41:39","modified_gmt":"2024-12-23T11:41:39","slug":"5-tips-prepare-your-online-store-for-the-holiday-season","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/5-tips-prepare-your-online-store-for-the-holiday-season\/","title":{"rendered":"5 Tips to Prepare Your Online Store for the Holiday Season"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">With the holiday season upon us, this is a very busy time for many online stores. Orders are coming in one after another, and deliveries are being shipped out as quickly as possible to make sure they can be placed under the tree in time.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">At this time of year, you may want to offer your customers an extra unique experience. Maybe you&#8217;re already offering a holiday discount, or communicating longer delivery times on your website.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If you&#8217;d like to do something special for your customers, we&#8217;ve got 5 handy tips to help you add some holiday sparkle to your online store!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Tip #1 A special holiday season banner<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Changing your website (or store page) banner can immediately give your online store a whole different look. Let your creativity flow &#8211; in Canva, for example &#8211; and make a festive banner for the holidays.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"317\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jouwweb.nl\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/Screenshot-2023-11-28-at-16.11.20-1024x317.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3048\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/Screenshot-2023-11-28-at-16.11.20-1024x317.png 1024w, https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/Screenshot-2023-11-28-at-16.11.20-300x93.png 300w, https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/Screenshot-2023-11-28-at-16.11.20-768x238.png 768w, https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/Screenshot-2023-11-28-at-16.11.20-1536x476.png 1536w, https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/Screenshot-2023-11-28-at-16.11.20.png 1910w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Tip #2 Festive gift-wrap options<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Don&#8217;t you just love when your favorite online stores can deliver your Christmas shopping already wrapped? Give your customers a gift-wrap option during the holiday season, such as festive wrapping paper or gift bags. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">You can use the product personalization feature to add gift-wrap options to your products. It&#8217;s also possible to offer wrap as an individual product. You can even add it to the product suggestions displayed during checkout.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-style-default\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"352\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jouwweb.nl\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/Screenshot-2023-11-29-at-13.34.09-1024x352.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3049\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/Screenshot-2023-11-29-at-13.34.09-1024x352.png 1024w, https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/Screenshot-2023-11-29-at-13.34.09-300x103.png 300w, https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/Screenshot-2023-11-29-at-13.34.09-768x264.png 768w, https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/Screenshot-2023-11-29-at-13.34.09.png 1110w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Tip #3 Delivery information for the holiday season<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Postal services are much busier during the holiday season, so you may be dealing with longer delivery times. Perhaps you also have a cut-off date for orders to be shipped in time for Christmas.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">To keep your customers informed and help ensure gifts are placed under the tree in time, you can enable the top bar on your website. This way you can clearly communicate delivery times, a cut-off date, and more.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Tip #4 Custom festive gift box<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Did you know you can offer your customers the opportunity to put together their own gift box?<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Does your store sells a variety of products, that can be combined? You can use the product personalization feature to offer a custom gift box product, as this feature allows you to offer multiple choice options so your customers can select the products they want. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">You can even offer varying sizes, such as a small box with 3 products and a large box with 5 products. Don&#8217;t forget to communicate details such as additional costs for certain products.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"638\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jouwweb.nl\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/Screenshot-2023-11-29-at-16.35.59-1024x638.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3064\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/Screenshot-2023-11-29-at-16.35.59-1024x638.png 1024w, https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/Screenshot-2023-11-29-at-16.35.59-300x187.png 300w, https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/Screenshot-2023-11-29-at-16.35.59-768x479.png 768w, https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/Screenshot-2023-11-29-at-16.35.59.png 1102w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Tip #5 Share your Christmas listings on social media<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If you run an online store, there&#8217;s a good chance you&#8217;re already active on social media. Regular posts during the holiday season can help drive more sales, so make sure you&#8217;re as visible as possible on all your social pages.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Besides informative posts about delivery times and seasonal products, have some fun with behind-the-scenes photos, promotions, or even a festive poll!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-light-gray-background-color has-background\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-not-stacked-on-mobile is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"maak-nu-jouw-website-met-jouwweb\">Build your website with Webador today!<\/h3>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:30%\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-right is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-89b4c9e9 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alignright\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"\/?utm_source=jouwweb-blog&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=cta-blok#signup-modal\">Start now<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>With the holiday season upon us, this is a very busy time for many online stores. Orders are coming in one after another, and deliveries are being shipped out as quickly as possible to make sure they 